         <t:abstract>
            <t:p>A letter (<t:foreign xml:lang="la">prosphoneticus</t:foreign> ) by <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3255CyrilI">Cyril I</t:persName> addressed to Princesses Arcadia and Marina, sisters of
                  <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9480Theodosi">Theodosius II</t:persName>. The letter, originally composed in Greek
               according to <t:bibl type="CPG">
                  <t:ptr target="bm:CPG3"/>
               </t:bibl>discusses the nature of Christ, aiming to limit the influence of <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS7553Nestoriu">Nestorius</t:persName>. Its Gǝʿǝz version is transmitted as part of <t:title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3309Qerellos"> collection.</t:title>
            </t:p>
         </t:abstract>
